BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 615.55 Tm (Step: 1) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 600.32 Tm (Title: Map) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 585.10 Tm (Action: Inventory every data destination.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 569.87 Tm (Detail: Include retries, tools, support, and backups.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 554.65 Tm (Step: 2) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 539.42 Tm (Title: Verify) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 524.20 Tm (Action: Capture account-specific retention evidence.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 508.97 Tm (Detail: Record provider, region, model, feature, and date.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 493.75 Tm (Step: 3) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 478.52 Tm (Title: Constrain) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 463.30 Tm (Action: Allow only verified routes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 448.07 Tm (Detail: Remove payload logging and unverified fallbacks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 432.85 Tm (Step: 4) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 417.62 Tm (Title: Exercise) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 402.40 Tm (Action: Run synthetic retention tests.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 387.17 Tm (Detail: Record findings and retest after configuration changes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 364.95 Tm (Separate zero training, zero provider retention, and zero application retention in every answer. They are different) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 349.72 Tm (commitments. For OpenAI, verify whether the organization has approved Zero Data Retention controls and whether the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 334.50 Tm (chosen endpoint and features qualify. For Anthropic, verify contractual retention arrangements and feature coverage) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 319.27 Tm (rather than treating ordinary commercial API access as automatically ZDR. For AWS Bedrock and GCP Vertex,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.05 Tm (inspect the exact managed service, model publisher, region, abuse-monitoring terms, and customer-controlled logging) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 288.82 Tm (settings. Marketplace models and optional tools may introduce different conditions. Do not transplant a direct provider) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 273.60 Tm (agreement onto a cloud reseller route. Store dated evidence of the account settings and governing terms. Where a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 258.37 Tm (setting cannot be inspected directly, obtain written confirmation identifying the account and service rather than relying) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 243.15 Tm (on a generic sales statement.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 227.92 Tm (Configure the product around an allowlist of verified routes, with separate credentials and project boundaries where) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 212.70 Tm (practical. Reject unsupported attachments, persistent assistants, caching modes, or tool integrations on workloads sold) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 197.47 Tm (as ZDR unless their retention behavior is documented and compatible. Disable optional payload logging and tracing;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 182.25 Tm (redact before records enter monitoring systems rather than scheduling deletion after ingestion. Examine queues, retry) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 167.02 Tm (stores, dead-letter queues, embeddings, uploaded files, and support exports. Provider ZDR does not erase your database) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 151.80 Tm (or an engineer's debug capture. Keep operational metadata only where justified, with defined fields and expiry. On) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 136.57 Tm (provider failure, return a clear retryable error or use another verified route; never silently send a protected workload to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 121.35 Tm (an ordinary fallback. Track route identifiers with requests so an incident can identify affected accounts without) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 106.12 Tm (retaining their prompts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 90.90 Tm (Test the promise using synthetic canary strings, never real customer secrets. Submit a canary through success, timeout,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 75.67 Tm (retry, support, and deletion paths, then inspect every store your team controls. Absence from local logs is evidence) Tj ET
